        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Who Dwell is a slow-burn folk-horror descent where light is your only protection. Explore a cursed underground excavation, restore ancient shrines, and manage your fading lantern as something watches from the dark. Survival depends on exploration and ritual choices, not combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven folk horror with psychological elements, inspired by folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your lifeline so manage your torch, oil and candles to push back the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension, dread and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and interactable items that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings based on your choices and how you engage with what dwells below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 2~ hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content described on this page is included in the current version of the game.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Who Dwell is a slow-burn folk-horror descent where light is your only protection. Explore a cursed underground excavation, restore ancient shrines, and manage your fading lantern as something watches from the dark. Survival depends on exploration and ritual choices, not combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven folk horror with psychological elements, inspired by folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your lifeline so manage your torch, oil and candles to push back the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric tension, dread and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and interactable items that tell the story of those who came before and those who were here long before them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different endings based on your choices and how you engage with what dwells below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 2~ hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the darkness. Endure the isolation. And uncover the truth before you disappear too.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All content described on this page is included in the current version of the game.</p>",
        "short_description": "Your lantern is your only protection. Something watches from the dark. Will you restore the balance… or unleash what waits below?",
